// spec: FUN-012
//
// ⚠️ Expected to FAIL compiled, because of C-2: the C back end refuses a
// function nested more than one level deep. The interpreter is right, so this
// is an ordinary conformance case and the compiled failure records C-2.

function Outer ();
begin
    function Middle ();
    begin
        function Inner ();
        begin
            Exit 3;
        end

        Exit Inner () + 20;
    end

    Exit Middle () + 100;
end

WriteLn (Outer ());
